---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Jiaqi Yu, PhD"
  description="About Jiaqi Yu, PhD — Instructional Innovation Leader at UNT Health at Fort Worth. Building sustainable Communities of Practice for health sciences education."
>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <div class="about-hero flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 mb-16 items-start">
      <div class="headshot-wrapper">
        <img src="/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Headshot of Jiaqi Yu, PhD." class="headshot" />
      </div>
      <div class="bio-wrapper">
        <h1 class="mt-0 mb-3">Jiaqi Yu, PhD</h1>
        <p class="about-tagline">Building communities · Designing possibilities · Empowering educators</p>
        <p class="about-bio">
          I build Communities of Practice, faculty development programs, and scholarly infrastructure in health sciences education. What connects the work is a commitment to making scholarship sustainable for the people doing it — clinical educators, instructional designers, and emerging scholars building careers in a field that rarely stops changing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- NOW -->
    <div class="mb-6">
      <p class="callout-eyebrow">Now</p>
      <p class="focus-body">
        At UNT Health at Fort Worth, I serve as Assistant Director of Instructional Innovation and Project Management. As founder of the Scholarship of Teaching and Learning Collective, I have built five interconnected Communities of Practice — now engaging 150+ faculty and 20+ active SoTL projects — and I lead institution-wide initiatives in faculty development, instructional design, and educational research.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THEN -->
    <div class="mb-6">
      <p class="callout-eyebrow">Then</p>
      <p class="focus-body">
        Across more than a decade of practice, I have shaped how higher education prepares instructional design teams to lead complex projects — through cross-institutional collaborations with the Online Learning Consortium, EDUCAUSE and Penn State's ID2ID program, and the POD Network. My co-led redesign of an online public health course earned the Delta Omega Innovative Curriculum Runner-Up Award in 2024. I hold a PhD in Curriculum & Instructional Technology (co-major, Human–Computer Interaction) from Iowa State University.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- NEXT -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <p class="callout-eyebrow">Next</p>
      <p class="focus-body">
        Three commitments shape my next chapter: sustaining educator well-being inside ambitious instructional change; integrating generative AI into teaching with rigor, transparency, and care for faculty trust; and building an ICF-credentialed coaching practice grounded in the same principles that guide my faculty development work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Education + Service -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="about-section-heading">Education & credentials</h2>
        <ul class="about-list">
          <li><strong>PhD, Curriculum & Instructional Technology</strong> (co-major, Human–Computer Interaction) — Iowa State University</li>
          <li><strong>MEd, Curriculum Studies and Teacher Development</strong> — University of Toronto</li>
          <li><strong>BA</strong> — Beijing Normal University</li>
          <li><strong>IELOL Fellow</strong>, Online Learning Consortium</li>
          <li><strong>Certified Quality Matters Coordinator</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="about-section-heading">Selected service</h2>
        <ul class="about-list">
          <li>Advisory Committee, EDUCAUSE / Penn State ID2ID Peer Mentoring Program (2024–2025)</li>
          <li>Board of Directors nomination, Online Learning Consortium (2024–2026)</li>
          <li>Peer mentor across multiple ID2ID cohorts</li>
          <li>Founder, Scholarship of Teaching and Learning Collective at UNT Health</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Link blocks -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
      <a href="/about/roots/" class="link-block">
        <span class="link-block-eyebrow">Beyond the CV</span>
        <span class="link-block-title">Roots & Leadership Philosophy →</span>
        <span class="link-block-desc">What guides my work — first-generation scholar, immigrant, working parent, and what those experiences produce in professional practice.</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/cv/CV_Jiaqi_Yu.pdf" class="link-block">
        <span class="link-block-eyebrow">Full record</span>
        <span class="link-block-title">Download CV (PDF) →</span>
        <span class="link-block-desc">12 pages. Education, experience, publications, presentations, awards, service, grants.</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact CTA -->
    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <p class="text-lg mb-4">Open to collaboration, speaking, and mentoring conversations.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .headshot-wrapper { flex-shrink: 0; width: 240px; }
  .bio-wrapper { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .headshot { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px; display: block; }

  .about-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .about-bio {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .callout-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }
  .focus-body {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: #FAFAFA;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about-section-heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
  }
  .about-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .about-list li {
    padding: 0.6rem 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
  }
  .about-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .link-block {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .link-block:hover { border-color: var(--color-gold); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .link-block-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .link-block-title {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .link-block-desc { display: block; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-ink); line-height: 1.5; }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: white;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-navy-light); }
</style>